flowchart TD
    Start([Login]) --> Creds[Submit credentials]
    Creds --> Valid{Valid?}
    Valid -- No --> Reject[Reject]
    Valid -- Yes --> Verified{Verified?}
    Verified -- No --> Verify[Verification flow]
    Verified -- Yes --> Session[Issue session]
    Session --> Cookie[Set cookies]
    Cookie --> Redirect[Redirect to app]